199
00:09:37,230 --> 00:09:40,090
即极端区域的失衡。
So, an imbalance at the extreme.

200
00:09:41,410 --> 00:09:44,370
失衡看起来和止损单类似，但不会出现零值。
Now, an imbalance will look similar to stops, except it won’t have zeros.

202
00:09:44,370 --> 00:10:01,310
可能是10×50、20×150、30×200，以及100×200。
You might have something like 10 × 50, 20 × 150, 30 × 200, and 100 × 200.

204
00:10:01,730 --> 00:10:07,370
若在极端区域看到这种情况，且之前有激进的主导权，
Okay? So, again, if you see this at an extreme, after we’ve had a very aggressive initiative,

206
00:10:08,110 --> 00:10:12,210
你就知道，极端区域的失衡预示着筋疲力尽点。
you know that an imbalance at an extreme signals an exhaustion point.

207
00:10:12,730 --> 00:10:15,170
记住，筋疲力尽点不等于顶部。
Remember, an exhaustion point does not mean a top.

208
00:10:15,650 --> 00:10:18,206
筋疲力尽点仅意味着市场已到达一个点，现在需要休整，且高概率会进行休整。
An exhaustion point simply means the market has reached a point

