这种情况常见于活跃市场，比如债券市场、E-迷你标普。
And you see this in the thicker markets, like the bond markets, the E-mini S&Ps.

217
00:10:43,930 --> 00:10:49,925
而高成交量失衡，就是成交量剧增，相对成交量很高。
But a high-volume imbalance is simply where we churn over an aggressive amount of volume, a high relative volume.

