00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:43,650
因此，它要么显示为零，即止损单，要么显示为低成交量的失衡。
Therefore, it either shows zeros, which are stops, or it shows the imbalance with low volume.

232
00:11:44,330 --> 00:11:50,190
如果有大量成交或大量流动性提供，你会在极端位置看到高成交量失衡。
If there's high volume or high liquidity being provided, you will see a high-volume imbalance at the extreme.

234
00:11:50,190 --> 00:11:56,730
这就是你可能看到的筋疲力尽高点或低点的三种变体。
So, these are the three variations of an exhaustion high or low that you can expect to see.

