Your second option is to buy the first pullback.

279
00:14:18,930 --> 00:14:21,470
这可能是概率最高的机会
Okay, and this is probably the highest probability opportunity.

280
00:14:21,850 --> 00:14:28,590
所以，一旦回调并出现吸纳，就做多，寻找小反弹
So, once it pulls back and we see the absorption, we simply get long, looking for that little bounce.

282
00:14:29,670 --> 00:14:33,330
第三个选择？其实，抱歉，只有这两种机会
And our third... Oh, actually, sorry. Those are the only opportunities, okay?

283
00:14:33,450 --> 00:14:39,530
所以，首先是反向交易，但概率最高的是买入第一次回调机会
So, it’s first and foremost the fade, but the highest probability is to buy that first pullback opportunity.

285
00:14:39,530 --> 00:14:41,130
现在，我们来确认一下
Now, let’s just establish

