突破结束后市场可能会回撤
In which case, once the break is over, the markets may be pulled back.

297
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:35,863
一旦它再次开始上涨
Once it starts to move higher again,

298
00:15:35,863 --> 00:15:38,758
它会给你需要的线索
it gives the kind of clues you need,

299
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:44,549
注意这个技巧
