01:23:06,950 --> 01:23:11,061
它们确实倾向于从平衡状态开始趋势，但更多情况下，趋势出现是因为市场处于失衡模式。
They do tend to start trending from a balanced state,

559
01:23:11,061 --> 01:23:16,407
but most often, they’re trending because they’re in an imbalanced mode.

561
01:23:16,410 --> 01:23:19,270
我们往往在突破日以及趋势日中发现这些信号。
we tend to find these on breakout days as well as trending days.

